            <ArticleTitle>[Experiment with the local effect of superhigh-frequency electromagnetic energy on biologically active points].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>40-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The use of microwaves for exciting biologically active points permits one to locate release electromagnetic energy in the region of the points. A 2375 field of the intensity that is sufficient for warning the tissues of the biologically active point causes the reflective changes in the somatic and vegetative indices in animals. The changes founded in the experiment are not strong and reversible.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
